WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.097 --> 00:00:03.878
YING NAN
Those who came before us...

00:00:05.089 --> 00:00:06.956
...made us who we are today.

00:00:09.003 --> 00:00:10.042
A legacy...

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.753
...of warriors.

00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:17.088
♪♪

00:00:18.347 --> 00:00:21.083
Everything you need
is already inside of you.

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:25.167
WONG
There's no going back.

00:00:27.464 --> 00:00:29.464
YING NAN
You are ready, Shang-Chi.

00:00:29.515 --> 00:00:32.120
♪♪

00:00:34.073 --> 00:00:36.667
SHANG-CHI
All of the training, all of the sacrifice.

00:00:38.487 --> 00:00:40.173
No one can hide forever.

00:00:41.839 --> 00:00:45.523
It's time to show
the world who I really am.

00:00:45.573 --> 00:00:46.323
KATY
Hell yeah.

00:00:46.472 --> 00:00:49.284
♪♪

00:00:52.058 --> 00:00:53.851
SOO
Two weeks ago you were parking cars,

00:00:53.901 --> 00:00:56.351
and you want me to believe
you're now saving the world?

00:00:56.401 --> 00:00:57.083
SHANG-CHI
Yeah.

